TIMING-27#1 Critical Warning
Invalid primary clock on hierarchical pin  
A primary clock Audio_Codec/audiocodec_master_clock/inst/clk_in1 is created on an inappropriate internal pin Audio_Codec/audiocodec_master_clock/inst/clk_in1. It is not recommended to create a primary clock on a hierarchical pin when its driver pin has a fanout connected to multiple clock pins
Related violations: <none>

LUTAR-1#1 Warning
LUT drives async reset alert  
LUT cell CU/next_state_reg[0]_i_3, with 2 or more inputs, drives asynchronous preset/clear pin(s) CU/next_state_reg[0]/PRE. The LUT may glitch and trigger an unexpected reset, even if it is a properly timed path.
Related violations: <none>

