LUT drives async reset alert  
LUT cell CU/next_state_reg[1]_i_3, with 2 or more inputs, drives asynchronous preset/clear pin(s) CU/next_state_reg[1]/CLR. The LUT may glitch and trigger an unexpected reset, even if it is a properly timed path.
